"Times New Roman";letter-spacing:1.6pt;mso-ansi-language:X-NONE;mso-fareast-language:
X-NONE'>Dan&#305;&#351;ma Kurulunun 14/11/2017 Sal&#305; günü (</span><span
style='font-size:9.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Arial",sans-serif;
mso-bidi-font-family:"Times New Roman";letter-spacing:1.6pt;mso-fareast-language:
X-NONE'>b</span><span lang=X-NONE style='font-size:9.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:
10.0pt;font-family:"Arial",sans-serif;mso-bidi-font-family:"Times New Roman";
letter-spacing:1.6pt;mso-ansi-language:X-NONE;mso-fareast-language:X-NONE'>ugün)
yapt&#305;&#287;&#305; toplant&#305;s&#305;nda siyasi parti gruplar&#305;
aras&#305;nda oy birli&#287;i sa&#287;lanamad&#305;&#287;&#305;ndan grubumuzun
a&#351;a&#287;&#305;daki önerisinin &#304;ç Tüzük’ün 19’uncu maddesi
gere&#287;ince Genel Kurulun onay&#305;na sunulmas&#305;n&#305;
sayg&#305;lar&#305;mla arz ederim.<o:p></o:p></span></p>

