mso-pagination:none;mso-hyphenate:none'><span style='font-size:9.0pt;
mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;font-family:"Arial",sans-serif;letter-spacing:1.6pt'>502
s&#305;ra say&#305;l&#305; Kanun Tasar&#305;s&#305;’n&#305;n 46’nc&#305; maddesi
üzerinde verilen ayn&#305; mahiyetteki önergelerin ikinci oylamas&#305;
s&#305;ras&#305;nda da karar yeter say&#305;s&#305;
bulunamam&#305;&#351;t&#305;. <o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-top:0cm;margin-right:2.0pt;margin-bottom:0cm;
margin-left:2.0pt;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:40.55pt;
mso-pagination:none;mso-hyphenate:none'><span style='font-size:9.0pt;
mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;font-family:"Arial",sans-serif;letter-spacing:1.6pt'>&#350;imdi
önergeleri tekrar oylar&#305;n&#305;za sunaca&#287;&#305;m ve karar yeter
say&#305;s&#305; arayaca&#287;&#305;m: Kabul edenler… Kabul etmeyenler… Karar
yeter say&#305;s&#305; vard&#305;r, ayn&#305; mahiyetteki önergeler kabul
edilmemi&#351;tir. <o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-top:0cm;margin-right:2.0pt;margin-bottom:0cm;
margin-left:2.0pt;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:40.55pt;
mso-pagination:none;mso-hyphenate:none'><span style='font-size:9.0pt;
mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;font-family:"Arial",sans-serif;letter-spacing:1.6pt'>502
s&#305;ra say&#305;l&#305; Kanun Tasar&#305;s&#305;’n&#305;n görü&#351;melerine
devam ediyoruz.<o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-top:0cm;margin-right:2.0pt;margin-bottom:0cm;
margin-left:2.0pt;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:40.55pt;
