mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;font-family:"Arial",sans-serif;letter-spacing:1.6pt'>Komisyon
ve Hükûmet yerinde.<o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-top:0cm;margin-right:2.0pt;margin-bottom:0cm;
