– Buyurun. (AK PART&#304; s&#305;ralar&#305;ndan alk&#305;&#351;lar)<o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-top:3.0pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:3.0pt;
margin-left:0cm;text-align:justify;text-indent:42.55pt;mso-hyphenate:none;
tab-stops:center 255.0pt'><span style='font-size:9.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;
mso-no-proof:yes'>7.- &#304;stanbul Milletvekili Mehmet Mu&#351;’un, Mu&#351;
Milletvekili Ahmet Y&#305;ld&#305;r&#305;m’&#305;n sata&#351;ma nedeniyle
yapt&#305;&#287;&#305; konu&#351;mas&#305; s&#305;ras&#305;nda Adalet ve
Kalk&#305;nma Partisine sata&#351;mas&#305; nedeniyle konu&#351;mas&#305;<o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-top:0cm;margin-right:2.0pt;margin-bottom:0cm;
margin-left:2.0pt;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:40.55pt;
mso-pagination:none;mso-hyphenate:none'><span style='font-size:9.0pt;
mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;font-family:"Arial",sans-serif;letter-spacing:1.6pt'>MEHMET
MU&#350; (&#304;stanbul) – Say&#305;n Ba&#351;kan, de&#287;erli
milletvekilleri; asl&#305;nda anlatmaya çal&#305;&#351;t&#305;&#287;&#305;m
hadise tam da budur. Bak&#305;n, biz insan olarak nerede
do&#287;aca&#287;&#305;m&#305;z&#305;, hangi &#351;artlar alt&#305;nda
do&#287;aca&#287;&#305;m&#305;z&#305;, kimin evlad&#305; olarak dünyaya
gelece&#287;imizi seçme hakk&#305;na sahip de&#287;iliz. Seçme hakk&#305;na
sahip olmad&#305;&#287;&#305;m&#305;z bir unsurdan dolay&#305; insanlara
farkl&#305; gözle hiçbir zaman bakmad&#305;k, bakamay&#305;z. <o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-top:0cm;margin-right:2.0pt;margin-bottom:0cm;
margin-left:2.0pt;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:40.55pt;
mso-pagination:none;mso-hyphenate:none'><span style='font-size:9.0pt;
mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;font-family:"Arial",sans-serif;letter-spacing:1.6pt'>D&#304;RAYET
TA&#350;DEM&#304;R (A&#287;r&#305;) – Allah Allah!<o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-top:0cm;margin-right:2.0pt;margin-bottom:0cm;
margin-left:2.0pt;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:40.55pt;
mso-pagination:none;mso-hyphenate:none'><span style='font-size:9.0pt;
mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;font-family:"Arial",sans-serif;letter-spacing:1.6pt'>MEHMET
MU&#350; (Devamla) - Ama buraya ç&#305;kan belli hatipler, maalesef ama
maalesef &#305;rkç&#305;l&#305;k yap&#305;yorsa buna sessiz kalamay&#305;z. <o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-top:0cm;margin-right:2.0pt;margin-bottom:0cm;
margin-left:2.0pt;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:40.55pt;
mso-pagination:none;mso-hyphenate:none'><span style='font-size:9.0pt;
mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;font-family:"Arial",sans-serif;letter-spacing:1.6pt'>Bak&#305;n,
a&#351;&#305;r&#305; güvenlikçi politikalar… De&#287;erli dostlar, Orta
Do&#287;u de&#287;i&#351;ik bir süreçten geçiyor. Birileri harita hesab&#305;
yap&#305;yor Orta Do&#287;u’da. <o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-top:0cm;margin-right:2.0pt;margin-bottom:0cm;
margin-left:2.0pt;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:40.55pt;
